  "=== the_brief",
  "Lenses cost forty dollars now. You point one at a stranger on the train and it shows you, for a few seconds, what is passing through their mind. Some courts admit the recordings. This one does.",
  "",
  "The file lands on your desk on a Monday with a note from the head of chambers: *Nobody wants this. Do you?* Inside are a bus driver, a four-second recording, and a charge of planning a vehicular attack. Every newsroom in the city already has the clip.",
  "",
