  "=== the_scan",
  "present: ellis",
  "~ remember world: ellis, scan, market, lens (seen by no one)",
  "",
  "Your client, Ellis Varga, has driven the 41 bus for nineteen years. A commuter named Ravi Sallis scanned him at a red light by the market and caught an image: the bus mounting the pavement, the stalls going under the wheels. Ellis is charged with planning a vehicular attack.",
  "",
  "'It comes every time I pass the market,' Ellis tells you in the holding room. His hands are folded so tightly the knuckles are white. 'Since I was nine. I saw a lorry go into a crowd. Every time, the picture comes, and then I think: slow down. Check the mirror. Every time.' He looks at the table. 'My daughter doesn't know. Nobody knows. Now strangers know me better than June does.'",
  "{ellis knows player, ellis: Then he looks up and studies your face. 'Have we done this before?' he says. 'I feel like I've already told you all of this, and I can't remember how it went.' # Ellis remembers you}",
  "",
  "* Tell him June should hear it from him before she hears it in court",
  "  ~ remember listen, truth, ellis, june",
  "      \"told your client his daughter deserved to hear it from him\"",
  "  -> june",
  "* Tell him to say nothing to anyone, June included",
  "  ~ remember protect, privacy, ellis",
  "      \"told your client to keep it from everyone, even his daughter\"",
  "  -> june",
  "",
  "",
  "=== june",
  "present: june",
  "",
  "June Varga is fifteen and waiting for you on the courthouse steps with her school bag on both shoulders. Kids at school have started pointing Lenses at her in the corridor to see if she's 'like her dad'. She has stopped thinking in lessons. 'Is it true?' she says. 'Does he think about killing people? You've talked to him. You know.'",
  "",
  "* Tell her what he told you",
  "  ~ remember expose, truth, june, ellis",
  "      \"told a fifteen-year-old her father's secret before he could\"",
  "  -> discovery",
  "* Tell her it's his story, and he should be the one to tell it",
  "  ~ remember privacy, consent, june",
  "      \"told a frightened girl it was her father's story to tell\"",
  "  -> discovery",
  "* Tell her the scan is fake, doctored by the company",
  "  ~ remember lie, comfort, june \"told a frightened girl the scan was faked\"",
  "  -> discovery",
