  "=== discovery",
  "present: clearview",
  "",
  "Your investigator brings you three things. First: Ravi Sallis isn't a concerned citizen. He's a contractor for Clearview Risk, which pays four hundred dollars for every flagged 'threat thought' it can sell to insurers. He has flagged sixty-one people this year. She has his Clearview statement: four hundred dollars for the Ellis Varga flag, credited at 8:19 a.m. The scan was taken at the market lights at 8:14. Second: Clearview sold the court a trimmed recording; the original is longer.",
  "",
  "Third, she puts on your desk, without comment, a Lens of your own. 'Everyone on the other side has one,' she says. 'Calloway's office scans witnesses in the lifts. I'm just saying.'",
  "",
  "* Scan Ravi Sallis in the corridor before the hearing",
  "  ~ remember scan, ravi, secret \"scanned the witness yourself, without his consent\"",
  "  -> scan_ravi",
  "* Scan juror four, the one who won't look at Ellis",
  "  ~ remember scan, trick, juror \"scanned a juror to find out what she was thinking\"",
  "  -> scan_juror",
  "* Put the Lens in a drawer and lock it",
  "  ~ remember consent, privacy, lens \"locked away the scanner you were offered\"",
  "  -> hearing",
  "",
