  "=== scan_ravi",
  "~ ravi_scanned = true",
  "",
  "You point it at him from behind a pillar and it takes three seconds. Ravi Sallis is thinking about a bank letter: FINAL NOTICE in red. Then his daughter's face in a hospital bed. Then four hundred dollars, written out like a prayer. You know exactly how to break him on the stand. You also know you just did to him what he did to Ellis.",
  "",
  "* Pocket the Lens and go in -> hearing",
