  "=== scan_juror",
  "~ juror_scanned = true",
  "",
  "Juror four is a woman in a green cardigan. Three seconds: a boy on a bicycle. A bus. A hospital corridor with the lights too bright. Her son. She lied in jury selection, or she was never asked. If the court knew, she'd be removed. But the only way the court could know is if you told them how you know.",
  "",
  "* Pocket the Lens and go in -> hearing",
