  "=== full_record",
  "present: june, jury, calloway",
  "~ remember world: ellis, careful, mirror (strength 2)",
  "~ doubt jury, june about ellis, danger, market (belief 0.4)",
  "",
  "The judge grants the order over Calloway's objection, and the next morning the full recording plays. The bus, the pavement, the stalls going under: four seconds. Then eight more that the jury has never seen. Ellis's hands tighten on the wheel. His eyes go to the mirror. In his head, in his own voice, steady as a prayer: Slow down. Check the mirror. Slow down. The bus in the recording brakes. A girl with a pushchair crosses safely in front of it.",
  "",
  "Clearview cut those eight seconds before they sold the clip.",
  "",
  "* Call Ravi Sallis to the stand -> cross",
  "",
