  "=== hallway",
  "present: ravi",
  "",
  "At the lunch break Ravi Sallis finds you by the vending machines. His hands are shaking.",
  "{ravi knows listen, ravi: 'You asked me if I'd ever had a thought I was ashamed of,' he says. 'Nobody's ever asked me that. I've been thinking about it all morning.' # Ravi remembers the stand}",
  "{not ravi knows listen, ravi and ravi knows bounty: 'You made me say my price in front of everyone,' he says. 'Fine. Now they all know. So I've got nothing left to lose by saying the rest.' # Ravi remembers the stand}",
  "{not ravi knows listen, ravi and not ravi knows bounty: 'You didn't even look at me up there,' he says. 'You looked at the jury the whole time, like I was furniture.' He laughs, badly. 'Maybe that's fair.'}",
  "'I want to take it back. All of it. I've flagged sixty-one people. Clearview says if I recant they'll sue me for breach. I have a daughter. She has a heart thing.' He looks at you like a man looking for a door.",
  "",
  "* Give him the number of a lawyer who'll take Clearview on for free",
  "  ~ remember protect, comfort, ravi \"found him a lawyer when he was afraid\"",
  "  -> preparation",
  "* Tell him to recant on the stand, or you'll make sure his sixty-one find out who he is",
  "  ~ remember humiliate, expose, ravi \"threatened him with his own sixty-one victims\"",
  "  -> preparation",
  "* Keep him talking while your phone records in your pocket",
