  "present: ellis, june, clearview",
  "",
  "Outside, the reporters have Lenses in their hands like microphones. 'Ellis! What were you thinking when you heard the verdict?' A dozen little lights point at his head. He looks at you before deciding whether to answer.",
  "{motive == \"career\": Half the Lenses on the steps are pointed at you. This is the moment you took the case for, and it is smaller and louder than you imagined.}",
  "",
  "* Step between Ellis and the scanners. He owes them no thought",
  "  ~ remember protect, privacy, ellis (seen by ellis, june)",
  "      \"stood between your client and the cameras\"",
  "  -> the_route",
  "* Help him explain the difference between a thought and a plan",
  "  ~ remember truth, consent, ellis (seen by ellis, june)",
