  "=== convicted",
  "present: ellis, june",
  "",
  "At sentencing, Ellis is given six years. He's allowed ten minutes with June in a room with a table bolted to the floor. Afterwards he asks to see you. 'Will you keep going?' he says. 'With the appeal. Not for me. For the next one.'",
  "",
  "* Promise him you'll take it all the way up",
